## Payment State Machine Summary

```
Order status:   PENDING_PAYMENT ──────────────────────────────► PLACED/READY
                                         ▲ (confirmCapturedPayment)
                                         │
Payment status: PENDING ─► SUCCESS ──────┘
                         └─► FAILED
                         └─► CANCELLED
                         └─► REFUNDED

paymentState (client):
  AWAITING_PAYMENT   → No attempts yet
  PENDING            → Razorpay order created, no result yet
  RETRY_AVAILABLE    → ≥1 failed attempt, <3 total, can retry
  ATTEMPTS_EXHAUSTED → 3 terminal attempts reached
  CONFIRMING         → Payment succeeded but order not yet released
  PAID               → Order released
  NOT_REQUIRED       → Non-payment order (cash/QR without payment)
```

